{"seq":1,"slug":"chinese","title":"七年级语文","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":3,"docCount":9,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-7/chinese","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"七年级语文-简介\">七年级语文 简介</h1><p>七年级语文是初中三年语文学习的起点，承接小学的字词识读、衔接八九年级的文学鉴赏与中考备考。本 hub 只覆盖<strong>七年级</strong>的核心能力建设：现代文读法入门、记叙文为主的写作起步、文言文零基础入门——不追求文学史的系统性，也不涉及中考应试技巧，那些属于后续年级。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-与兄弟-hub-的分工边界\">本 hub 与兄弟 hub 的分工边界</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Hub</th>\n<th>阶段定位</th>\n<th>阅读</th>\n<th>写作</th>\n<th>文言/古诗</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>七年级语文（本 hub）</strong></td>\n<td>入门·打基础</td>\n<td>记叙文·说明文·古诗词赏析的基本方法</td>\n<td>描写技巧、记叙文、应用文</td>\n<td>实词虚词、基本句式、《论语》等浅易篇目</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../../grade-8/chinese/\">八年级语文</a></td>\n<td>进阶·文体扩展</td>\n<td>小说·散文·戏剧的文体分析</td>\n<td>议论文·说明文·创意写作</td>\n<td>唐宋诗词、文言散文、文学批评</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../../grade-9/chinese/\">九年级语文</a></td>\n<td>冲刺·中考导向</td>\n<td>中考阅读题型</td>\n<td>中考作文</td>\n<td>文言文系统复习</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>简言之：本 hub 教「怎么读懂、怎么写完整」，八年级教「分文体、写得有理」，九年级教「按考点拿分」。同册三章之间也有先后：读法（第一章）是写作（第二章）的输入，文言入门（第三章）相对独立但与古诗词赏析互为语境。</p>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><p><strong>面向学生（按学期推进）：</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>先打通现代文读法：<a href=\"reading-comprehension/narrative-analysis\">记叙文分析</a> → <a href=\"reading-comprehension/expository-reading\">说明文阅读</a> → <a href=\"reading-comprehension/poetry-appreciation\">古诗词赏析</a>。</li>\n<li>把「会读」转成「会写」：<a href=\"writing-skills/descriptive-writing\">描写技巧</a> → <a href=\"writing-skills/narrative-essay\">记叙文写作</a> → <a href=\"writing-skills/letter-application\">应用文写作</a>。</li>\n<li>文言文从词到句到篇：<a href=\"classical-chinese/classical-vocabulary\">文言实词与虚词</a> → <a href=\"classical-chinese/sentence-patterns\">文言句式</a> → <a href=\"classical-chinese/classical-texts\">经典篇目精读</a>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>面向家长 / 教师：</strong> 优先用第一章的「答题策略」与第二章的范文结构作教学辅助；文言文章节配合诵读，先求语感再讲语法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><ul>\n<li>小学阶段的常用字词读写与基本造句能力。</li>\n<li>能完整读完一篇千字以内的现代文并复述大意。</li>\n<li>文言文章节<strong>无需</strong>任何古文基础，从零讲起。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>学好七年级语文的关键不在技巧而在量：每天三十分钟课外阅读、每周一篇写作练习、文言篇目反复诵读，方法章节负责把这些练习变得有方向。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"reading-comprehension","title":"阅读理解","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-7/chinese/reading-comprehension","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"narrative-analysis","title":"七年级语文 — 记叙文分析","url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-7/chinese/reading-comprehension/narrative-analysis"},{"seq":2,"slug":"expository-reading","title":"七年级语文 — 说明文阅读","url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-7/chinese/reading-comprehension/expository-reading"},{"seq":3,"slug":"poetry-appreciation","title":"七年级语文 — 古诗词赏析","url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-7/chinese/reading-comprehension/poetry-appreciation"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"writing-skills","title":"写作技能","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-7/chinese/writing-skills","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"descriptive-writing","title":"七年级语文 — 描写技巧","url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-7/chinese/writing-skills/descriptive-writing"},{"seq":2,"slug":"narrative-essay","title":"七年级语文 — 记叙文写作","url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-7/chinese/writing-skills/narrative-essay"},{"seq":3,"slug":"letter-application","title":"七年级语文 — 应用文写作","url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-7/chinese/writing-skills/letter-application"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"classical-chinese","title":"文言文","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-7/chinese/classical-chinese","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"classical-vocabulary","title":"七年级语文 — 文言实词与虚词","url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-7/chinese/classical-chinese/classical-vocabulary"},{"seq":2,"slug":"sentence-patterns","title":"七年级语文 — 文言句式","url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-7/chinese/classical-chinese/sentence-patterns"},{"seq":3,"slug":"classical-texts","title":"七年级语文 — 经典篇目精读","url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-7/chinese/classical-chinese/classical-texts"}]}]}